---
omnikb_type: khyp
id: kb.hyp.lark-cli
name: lark-cli 探索笔记
tags:
- domain.lark-cli
- hypotheses
maturity: stable
summary: 探索 lark-cli 认证命令的参数规则和错误处理行为
scene:
  tool: lark-cli
  os: Windows 10
  timestamp: '2026-04-16'
hypotheses:
- id: invalid_flag_exit_1
  kind: policy
  maturity: deprecated
  summary: 传入未知参数或必填标志位为空时，CLI 触发参数解析错误，返回退出码 1 并打印用法说明。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --invalid-flag test
  format_out:
    exit_code: 1
    output_contains:
    - 'Usage:'
  evidence: 1
  counterexamples: 1
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: device_code_error_json_format
  kind: state
  maturity: stable
  summary: 当设备授权码（device-code）校验失败时，CLI 先输出状态提示“等待用户授权...”，随后输出结构化 JSON，且退出码固定为 3。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --device-code invalid_code_123
  format_out:
    exit_code: 3
    output_contains:
    - 等待用户授权...
    - '"ok": false'
    - '"type": "auth"'
  evidence: 3
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on:
  - invalid_flag_exit_1
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: domain_flag_combinable
  kind: policy
  maturity: living
  summary: --domain 标志可与 --device-code 组合传入，但不改变设备码校验失败时的退出码与 JSON 错误响应结构。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --domain calendar --device-code invalid_code_123
  format_out:
    exit_code: 3
    output_contains:
    - 等待用户授权...
    - '"ok": false'
  evidence: 2
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on:
  - device_code_error_json_format
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: required_value_missing_exits_1
  kind: policy
  maturity: deprecated
  summary: 当已定义的标志位（如 --device-code、--domain）缺失参数值时，CLI 触发参数解析层拦截，直接返回 exit 1 并输出
    Usage 说明。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --device-code
  format_out:
    exit_code: 1
    output_contains:
    - 'Usage:'
  evidence: 1
  counterexamples: 9
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: ''
  contradicts: []
- id: domain_validation_deferred
  kind: state
  maturity: living
  summary: --domain 参数的值合法性不在 CLI 前端校验，即使传入无效 domain 也不会阻断流程，最终错误反馈仅聚焦于 device_code
    状态。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --domain invalid_domain --device-code invalid_code_123
  format_out:
    exit_code: 3
    output_contains:
    - 'authorization failed: The device_code is invalid'
  evidence: 1
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on:
  - domain_flag_combinable
  derived_from: domain_flag_combinable
  contradicts: []
- id: auth_progress_prefix_invariant
  kind: invariant
  maturity: stable
  summary: 只要成功携带 --device-code 参数值发起请求，CLI 必先在终端同步打印“等待用户授权...”文本，随后才输出最终结构化 JSON。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --device-code invalid_code_123
  format_out:
    exit_code: 3
    output_contains:
    - 等待用户授权...
  evidence: 5
  counterexamples: 1
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: device_code_error_json_format
  contradicts: []
- id: login_devicemode_exit0
  kind: state
  maturity: deprecated
  summary: 当使用 --recommend 配合 --no-wait 启动登录时，CLI 成功获取设备授权码并立即以退出码 0 结束，输出包含 device_code
    的 JSON 且不阻塞。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --recommend --no-wait
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - device_code
    - expires_in
  evidence: 1
  counterexamples: 1
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: domain_strict_validation_exit2
  kind: policy
  maturity: draft
  summary: --domain 参数在 CLI 本地进行即时强校验，传入非预设值会直接拦截并返回 validation 类型的 JSON 错误，固定触发退出码
    2。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --domain <invalid_domain>
  format_out:
    exit_code: 2
    output_contains:
    - unknown domain
    - '"type": "validation"'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts:
  - domain_validation_deferred
- id: login_missing_scope_exits2
  kind: policy
  maturity: deprecated
  summary: auth login 命令若未显式提供 --scope 或 --recommend 标志，CLI 会在逻辑校验层拦截并以退出码 2 提示用户必须指定授权权限。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --no-wait
  format_out:
    exit_code: 2
    output_contains:
    - 请指定要授权的权限
    - --recommend
  evidence: 1
  counterexamples: 6
  depends_on: []
  derived_from:
  - invalid_flag_exit_1
  contradicts: []
- id: scope_recommend_mutual_exclusion
  kind: policy
  maturity: draft
  summary: 执行 auth login 时，--scope 与 --recommend 或 --domain 标志严格互斥，混用将触发参数逻辑校验拦截。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --scope <scope> --recommend --no-wait
  format_out:
    exit_code: 2
    output_contains:
    - '"type": "validation"'
    - cannot use --scope together with --domain/--recommend
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: auth_check_unauthorized_state
  kind: transition
  maturity: draft
  summary: 当 auth check 携带有效 --scope 参数但当前环境无登录态或 Token 时，CLI 返回结构化授权缺失响应而非参数报错。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth check --scope <scope>
  format_out:
    exit_code: 1
    output_contains:
    - '"error": "not_logged_in"'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: version_notice_auto_inject
  kind: invariant
  maturity: draft
  summary: CLI 在多数命令（无论退出码为 0 或 1）的 JSON 响应顶层会自动注入 _notice.update 字段以提示版本升级。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli <command> [options]
  format_out:
    exit_code: 1
    output_contains:
    - '"_notice":'
    - '"update":'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: auth_status_bot_identity_on_unauthorized
  kind: state
  maturity: deprecated
  summary: auth status 命令在无用户登录态时仍成功执行（exit 0），返回的 JSON 会明确标记当前可用身份为 bot 并附带未登录提示。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth status
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - '"identity": "bot"'
    - No user logged in
  evidence: 2
  counterexamples: 1
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: ''
  contradicts: []
- id: device_code_response_fixed_schema
  kind: invariant
  maturity: deprecated
  summary: 成功获取设备授权码时，CLI 返回的 JSON 顶层结构固定包含 device_code、expires_in（默认600秒）和 hint 字段。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --recommend --no-wait
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - '"expires_in": 600'
    - '"hint":'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 1
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: login_devicemode_exit0
  contradicts: []
- id: login_help_recommends_bg_execution
  kind: policy
  maturity: living
  summary: CLI 官方帮助文档明确指示 AI Agent 应将登录命令置于后台运行，通过解析标准输出获取验证链接，以适配非交互自动化环境。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth login --help
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - Run it in the background
    - retrieve the verification URL
  evidence: 1
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on:
  - login_devicemode_exit0
  derived_from: ''
  contradicts: []
- id: auth_status_rejects_json_flag
  kind: policy
  maturity: draft
  summary: '`auth status` 命令已默认输出 JSON 格式，显式传入 `--json` 标志会被参数解析层识别为未知选项，导致退出码 1 并打印
    Usage。'
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth status --json
  format_out:
    exit_code: 1
    output_contains:
    - 'Usage:'
    - lark-cli auth status [flags]
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on:
  - invalid_flag_exit_1
  derived_from: ''
  contradicts: []
- id: auth_list_implicit_json
  kind: policy
  maturity: draft
  summary: '`auth list` 子命令默认采用 JSON 数组格式输出结果，无需依赖 `--json` 标志即可生成结构化数据。'
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth list
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - '['
    - tokenStatus
    - userName
    - userOpenId
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: ''
  contradicts: []
- id: auth_verify_bot_identity_bypass_network
  kind: invariant
  maturity: draft
  summary: 当当前身份为 bot 且无用户登录态时，`auth status --verify` 不会因网络校验失败而报错，而是直接复用本地状态以 exit
    0 返回相同 JSON。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth status --verify
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - '"identity": "bot"'
    - No user logged in
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: ''
  contradicts:
  - auth_status_bot_identity_on_unauthorized
- id: registry_user_token_plaintext_json
  kind: state
  maturity: draft
  summary: CLI 将用户 OAuth 令牌（含 accessToken、refreshToken、expiresAt）以完整明文 JSON 对象直接存储在
    Windows 注册表特定路径中，无需额外解密。
  format_in:
    command: reg query "HKCU\Software\LarkCli\keychain\user:<appId>:default"
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - REG_SZ
    - '"accessToken":'
    - '"refreshToken":'
    - '"expiresAt":'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: dpapi_appsecret_entropy_requirement
  kind: state
  maturity: draft
  summary: 应用密钥在注册表中受 Windows DPAPI 加密保护，解密必须提供特定格式的熵值字符串（lark-cli\x00appsecret:<appId>），否则无法还原明文。
  format_in:
    command: python -c "... CryptUnprotectData(..., entropy_bytes, ...)"
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - 'App secret:'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: oauth_v1_endpoint_deprecated
  kind: policy
  maturity: draft
  summary: 飞书开放平台用户令牌刷新功能已迁移至 v2 接口，请求旧版 `/authen/v1/oauth/token` 路径直接返回 HTTP 404，且有效刷新请求需使用表单编码提交。
  format_in:
    command: python -c "... urllib.request.Request('https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/authen/v1/oauth/token',
      ...)"
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - 'HTTP Error 404: 404 page not found'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
- id: v2_token_rotation
  kind: state
  maturity: draft
  summary: 飞书 v2 刷新接口成功响应时，会同时下发新的 access_token 与 refresh_token（发生令牌轮转），且 access_token
    有效期固定为 7200 秒。
  format_in:
    command: POST https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/authen/v2/oauth/token (application/x-www-form-urlencoded)
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - '"expires_in": 7200'
    - '"refresh_token_expires_in": 604800'
    - '"code": 0'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on: []
  derived_from:
  - oauth_v1_endpoint_deprecated
  contradicts: []
- id: cli_auth_state_external_gap
  kind: transition
  maturity: draft
  summary: 外部脚本成功刷新并持有有效 OAuth Token 后，直接执行 lark-cli auth status 仍返回 bot 身份与未登录提示，表明
    CLI 登录态判定不自动同步外部写入的注册表 token。
  format_in:
    command: lark-cli auth status
  format_out:
    exit_code: 0
    output_contains:
    - '"identity": "bot"'
    - '"note": "No user logged in"'
  evidence: 0
  counterexamples: 0
  depends_on:
  - registry_user_token_plaintext_json
  - v2_token_rotation
  derived_from: []
  contradicts: []
